direction: down
"derived-credit": "derived-credit\nAccounting completion is not physical caller\ncompletion; close roots only after caller and\nreader/GC grace evidence; audit pin never silently\nincrements marker count"
"execution-owner": "execution-owner\nClose generation-aware write admission before drain;\npre-admitted original and alias writers retain\nobligations until stopped or acknowledged"
"writer-closure": "writer-closure\nExact count=1-ownedDrop requires zero unaccounted\nnative credits; strict private-marker profile\nrejects generic/reference aliases and raw metadata\nwrites"
"storage-commit": "storage-commit\nTransfer still arena, scanner ownership and\naccounting before old PSTATE cleanup; successful\njoin alone cannot preserve already-freed marker\nstorage"
"audit-receipt": "audit-receipt\nReceipt binds generation, closed writer set,\nconfirmed exit/visibility, root/arena handoff and GC\ncut; count alone and timeout do not certify"
"auditor-transfer": "auditor-transfer\nLost response retains audit write lease; replacement\nonly after exact auditor cessation and visibility\nplus fresh GC cut and reread"
"single-drop": "single-drop\nAt exclusive cut, count 1 permits only missing\ndecrement and count 0 permits recording;\ninvalidation and decrement have separate progress"
"gc-cut": "gc-cut\nSerialize plain refcount/body audit with collector;\npreserve independent scanned root at count zero and\nkeep old storage owned"
"execution-owner" -> "writer-closure"
"execution-owner" -> "gc-cut"
"writer-closure" -> "audit-receipt"
"gc-cut" -> "audit-receipt"
"audit-receipt" -> "auditor-transfer"
"audit-receipt" -> "single-drop"
"single-drop" -> "derived-credit"
"auditor-transfer" -> "derived-credit"
"derived-credit" -> "storage-commit"
"execution-owner" -> "audit-receipt"
proof: "SysML -> ASCENT -> QNT / Lean; source + platform OPEN"
"storage-commit" -> proof
gain0: "private-marker-audit\nCurrent code does not establish a universal single-\nreference marker invariant; unsafe/open alias paths\nreject audit"
proof -> gain0
gain1: "repeatable-audit\nFailed join or response loss cannot release prior lease\nor authorize another writer"
proof -> gain1
gain2: "storage-preservation\nJoin-only or ordinary root pin does not override\nfree_still_objs; cleanup path must be refactored"
proof -> gain2
gain3: "modern-c-net-benefit\nNet gain depends on a genuinely closed private-marker\ndomain and shared support; no runtime speed or Zig-\nspecific saving established"
proof -> gain3
